1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
An entire royal world disappeared
beneath the sea.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
And it once belonged to
one of history's most famous queens.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
This was ancient Alexandria,
the city of Cleopatra.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Its royal quarter was filled with
palaces, temples, and grand harbours.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
But then, the ground beneath
this magnificent world began to sink.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Earthquakes shook the region.
Waves battered the coastline.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
And slowly, parts of the royal district
slipped beneath the Mediterranean.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Buildings collapsed.
Monuments vanished underwater.

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
For centuries, their remains
lay hidden beneath the waves.

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Then, in 1992,
underwater archaeologists began exploring.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
And what they discovered
was extraordinary.

12
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Enormous statues, massive columns,
and traces of royal buildings.

13
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
This wasn't just a collection
of sunken ruins.

14
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
It was part of a lost world
that once ruled the Mediterranean.

15
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
And incredibly...
some of it is still waiting beneath the sea.
